Name: Phosphor Icons
Short Name: phosphor-icons-core
URL: https://github.com/phosphor-icons/core
Version: 2.1.1
Revision: N/A
License: MIT
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: no
Shipped: yes

Description:
Fill-weight glyph paths used by the space icon picker. fill.js is generated
from @phosphor-icons/core by build/scripts/vendor-phosphor.mjs - do not
hand-edit.

Local Modifications:
None. Only a subset of the upstream glyph set is vendored.
